    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      302.38,
      565.15,
      348.17
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Southeast Bay of Bengal deep sea areas and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambantota via Trincomalee and Pottuvil.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      389.33,
      561.79,
      401.33
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area located in the Bay of Bengal, east of Sri Lanka, was located approximately 650 km east",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      411.29,
      562.13,
      423.29
    ],
    "text": "of Batticaloa. The system is expected to move northwestwards, away from the eastern coast of the island",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      431.31,
      559.4,
      445.25
    ],
    "text": "and likely to intensify into a 'depression' by tomorrow (November 15). Thereafter, it is likely to move north-",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      452.79,
      561.94,
      466.29
    ],
    "text": "northwestwards and intensify further into a cyclonic storm over the south and adjoining west-central Bay",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      473.09,
      204.3,
      486.59
    ],
    "text": "of Bengal around 16th November.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      515.21,
      561.94,
      528.71
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      535.49,
      561.71,
